# Trivy Ignore Configuration
# These vulnerabilities are in the Wolfi Linux base image or have compatibility issues

# ============================================================================
# BASE IMAGE VULNERABILITIES (Wolfi) - Cannot be patched by CLI code
# ============================================================================

# CVE-2026-8674: glibc DNS stub resolver DoS via long search domain
# Severity: MEDIUM
# Component: zlib 1.3.2-r6 (in Wolfi base image)
# Impact: Local DNS parsing issue - requires malformed DNS configuration
# Reason: Base image vulnerability - awaiting Wolfi update to zlib 1.3.2.1_rc20260601-r0
CVE-2026-8674

# CVE-2026-86805: glibc TOCTOU privilege escalation
# Severity: MEDIUM
# Component: glibc 2.44-r7 (in base image)
# Impact: Local attacker with file system access - requires race condition exploit
# Reason: Base image vulnerability - awaiting Wolfi update to glibc 2.44-r8
CVE-2026-86805

# CVE-2026-89092: glibc nscd stack overflow
# Severity: MEDIUM
# Component: glibc 2.44-r7 (in base image)
# Impact: Local DoS via nscd service - requires nscd to be running
# Reason: Base image vulnerability - awaiting Wolfi update to glibc 2.44-r8
CVE-2026-89092

# CVE-2026-95818: glibc local DoS and information disclosure
# Severity: MEDIUM
# Component: glibc 2.44-r7 (in base image)
# Impact: Local attacker can cause denial of service
# Reason: Base image vulnerability - awaiting Wolfi update to glibc 2.44-r8
CVE-2026-95818

# CVE-2026-85091: zlib heap buffer overflow
# Severity: MEDIUM
# Component: zlib 1.3.2-r6 (in Wolfi base image)
# Impact: Heap buffer overflow in compression library
# Reason: Base image vulnerability - awaiting Wolfi update to 1.3.2.1_rc20260601-r0
CVE-2026-85091

